This project is an original implementation. It does not contain code from any
third-party library; the only runtime dependencies are browser built-ins
(Canvas2D, SVG filters, CSS gradients).

Development tools (not shipped to end users):
  Node.js            — build, tests, verification
  Playwright         — headless browser automation for verify/ only

Category precedents consulted for feature scoping, no code reused:
  paper-shaders, Creatica, texture-lab, css-mesh, ShaderGradient, granim.js
